<title>UK: Go-Ahead Group year pretax profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Go-Ahead Group year pretax profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 29, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.6		   vs 21.9</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    11.9		   vs 8.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   135		    vs 112</p>
<p>NOTE - Bus and train operator Go-Ahead Group Plc said it would pay a final dividend of 3.7 pence making a total of 5.55 pence for the year.</p>
<p> Operating result	 14.75		  vs 10.29</p>
<p> Profit on assets sold  0.148		  vs nil</p>
<p> Interest payable	 3.03		   vs 1.77</p>
<p> Tax			  2.83		   vs 7.51</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.04		   vs 7.51</p>
<p> Retained profit	  6.68		   vs 5.76</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 28</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 12</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom ++ 44 171 542 7717</p>
